					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-385802#post-1243036</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-385802/potty#post-1243036</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 29 Aug 2011 05:32:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Communism will win</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>617958</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>On that note, I live in the suburbs, so I have access to a sewage system that takes the waste far, far away from me. The concept of a septic tank has always creeped me out, because it's a giant concrete box buried underground and you have no way of knowing what's inside it, and your refuse stays there forever (forever [FOR-E-VER]), just festering&#8230;</p> <p>Maybe I should make an SCP what lives in septic tanks, or is a septic tank, or whatever. Anything with septic tanks. *shudders*</p> <p>Oh, and this is a great story.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
